      <h1>US Social Security <span class="msv__shimmer">in Spain</span></h1>
      <p>Yes, you can receive US Social Security in Spain. The US-Spain Totalization Agreement ensures your benefits continue indefinitely. But tax treatment in Spain is different. Medicare doesn't work abroad. Here's what US retirees need to know about Social Security and Spain.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">7 min read</p>
